  "name": "Question 8",
  "problem": "| ${x}_{1}$ | **$1$** | **$2$** | **$3$** | **$4$** | **$5$** |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ${x}_{2}$ | **$10$** | **$25$** | **$32$** | **$42$** | **$15$** |\n| $y$ | $0$ | $-5$ | $-2$ | $2$ | $7$ |\n\nThe vector of coefficients of the plane $y={\\beta }_{1}{x}_{1}+{\\beta }_{2}{x}_{2}$ that best fits the data above can be found using multiple linear regression as \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}{\\beta }_{1} \\\\ {\\beta }_{2}\\end{aligned}]=({X}^{T}\\,X)^{-1}{X}^{T}y,\n$$\n\nwhere $X$ is the corresponding design matrix and $y$ is the observation vector. Which of the following is the design matrix $X$ in this context?",
